        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1764_6511.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> gruoß, und nachbarlich
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willighkeit</unclear>, zuvor, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrsamben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wohl</unclear>-
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelerte</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> liebe Herren, guote freündt
<lb n="4"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbaren</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/>Auf derselben, an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgangnen</unclear> schreiben,
<lb n="6"/>haben wir nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermanglen</unclear>, ihnen
<lb n="7"/>inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anttwurtt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovernehmen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogeben</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Erstlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anlangendt</unclear>, die be-
<lb n="9"/>siglung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">reversbriefs</unclear>, so auf unsers mit-
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhats</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewesnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vogts</unclear> der herrschafft
<lb n="11"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-59" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bürglen</unclear></placeName> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lawrenz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mercklers</unclear></persName> sigel gestellt
<lb n="12"/>worden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halten</unclear> wir nochmahlen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darfür</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>wann die herren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>, dz die brief
<lb n="14"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angedeüteter</unclear> besiglung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bekrefftiget</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>werden sollen, sie werden sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> be-
<lb n="16"/>schweren, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jehnig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrschafft</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>amptleüth auch die brief schreiben, mit
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> besiglung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">man</unclear> dieselben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bekrefftiget</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wil</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">imberst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kundten</unclear> wir, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auß</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beweglichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ursachen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemelten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> mit-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear> und alten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vogt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nöthigen</unclear>, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>wider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> willen besiglen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müeste</unclear>.
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sovil</unclear> aber den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">articül</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Buoß</unclear>-
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nakhon</unclear> antrifft, möchten wir, (wann es
<lb n="25"/>den herren nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuowider</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leiden</unclear>, wann
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jhr</unclear> amptman, oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jemand</unclear> andrer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>den herren geliebt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwann</unclear> mit gelegenheit,
<lb n="28"/>sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhero</unclear> hette <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verfüegt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">da</unclear> wellten
<lb n="29"/>wir, in desselben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bejwesen</unclear>, die sach durch
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhatsdeputirte</unclear> berathschlagen, und
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1764_6512.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jemedte</unclear> herren mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fernerer</unclear> freündt-
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">licher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">antwurt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begegnen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dann</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>ihnen jederzeit freündtlichen nachbarlichen
<lb n="34"/>willen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerweisen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seind</unclear> wir jederzeit
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> willig. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sämbtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">göttlicher</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>allmacht treüwlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevehlende</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="37"/>den <origDate when="1612" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">5-15</unclear>. Maji <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. 1612</origDate>.
<lb n="38"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear> der statt
<lb n="39"/>St. Gallen</orgName>.
<lb n="40"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrwürdigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolgelerten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>,
<lb n="41"/>custos, <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seniorn</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeinem</unclear> capitel
<lb n="42"/>des collegiat stifft St. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pelagyen</unclear></orgName> zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-19" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bischoff-
<lb n="43"/>zell</placeName>, unsern sonders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gün-stigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>herren und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freünden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachburen</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1764_6513.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1764_6514.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ans</unclear> <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Capitel <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bischoffzel</unclear></orgName> 1612. <origDate resp="#ner">5. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maij</unclear></origDate>
</p>
